guide polestar-experimental/riverglades-alliance-1
title Riverglades 1: Southern Watch, Turner's Logging Camp and Farholde Keep (experimental)
faction Alliance
levels 37-40
zone Riverglades
coords live
folder Riverglades · Experimental
why Forever's new zone, an alpha route written from players' recordings.
keywords riverglades, farholde, southern watch, turner's logging camp, wheeler's grange, terral's watch, experimental, alpha
next polestar-experimental/riverglades-alliance-2

# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Alliance, part 1 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone (123 sessions to 2026-11-12) and Forever's quest data (the client's quest records,
# QuestieDB 1.0.16 and EG Link) for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: the way in from Redridge through Blackrock Pass; the western hubs in one pass (Scout Bolain, Southern
# Watch, Turner's Logging Camp, the Bristle Hills, the Holmsby farm and the river, with Curly's rescue on the way
# back to the camp); Farholde Keep (flight path, inn); Wheeler's Grange; the plains up to Terral's Watch; Farholde
# Keep again.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): From Seed to Sprout after Unsavory Plant
# Food; Foal Play after My Kingdom for a Horse; Coyote Huntin' and Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds after Foal Play;
# Rescue Roundup after Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds; Fit for a Princess after Apple of My Eye; Stepped Out after Fit for
# a Princess; Song of the Strider after A Feast for Buzzards; A Few Furs for Friz after A Fur Trade; Watcher
# Cornelius's Rog'mar errands once his first two hunts are handed in.
# Elites, each behind a group choice: Snargl (40), Ombassa (41); the WANTED posters for Ghostmaw and Blademaster
# Kaijo (42) are taken at the end, for part 2's ground.
# Left out on purpose:
# - The Sharpest of Blades (95184): eight Solid Sharpening Stones, a blacksmith's make; 3 of 16 recorded players
#   handed it in.
# - Love Thy Neighbor (95330) and High Stakes (96009): both send you back to Turner's Logging Camp; part 4 takes
#   them when it heads west from Farholde Keep.

step Into the Riverglades
  when !zone "Riverglades"
  tip Experimental route (alpha). It follows what players did in the Riverglades and may still have rough spots: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Fly to Lakeshire in Redridge, then follow the road north out of town and up through Blackrock Pass: it comes down into the western Riverglades by the Bristle Hills.
  fly "Lakeshire"
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 44.8,8.9 "Blackrock Pass"
  zone Riverglades
  goto 16.0,68.5 "The western Riverglades"

step Scout Bolain
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip Scout Bolain waits beside the road east of the pass.
  accept 95147                          -- The Lost Scout

step Southern Watch
  tip Follow the road east to Southern Watch, the Alliance outpost above the river. The gnolls you passed on the way in are Captain Dalton's job: you go back for them after the lumber camp.
  turnin 95147                          -- Cedric Dalton
  accept 94678                          -- Gnoll Infestation
  accept 95148                          -- Southern Watch Gnoll Report: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep, keep it

step Snargl's Snout
  when group 94679
  tip Snargl is an elite gnoll (level 40) who roams the south-western camps of the Bristle Hills: grouping up is advised.
  accept 94679                          -- Cedric Dalton

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip North up the road to the lumber camp. Halligan Turner runs it; his third job, the saplings, comes once his plant food is in.
  accept 94842                          -- Unsavory Plant Food
  accept 94931                          -- Stolen Saws

step The Bristle Hills
  tip West into the Bristle Hills: the Redridge gnolls camp along the slopes on both sides of the road you came in on. The stolen saw blades lie in their camps.
  kill 255770 x8 quest 94678.1          -- Redridge Mystic
  kill 255772 x8 quest 94678.2          -- Redridge Trapper
  kill 255769 x6 quest 94678.3          -- Redridge Brute
  collect 266897 x8 quest 94931.1       -- Saw Blade

step Snargl
  when group 94679
  collect 265357 quest 94679.1 @16.1,73.2  -- Snargl's Snout

step Southern Watch
  tip Back east along the road to Southern Watch.
  turnin 94678                          -- Cedric Dalton

step Cedric Dalton
  when onquest 94679
  turnin 94679

step Holmsby farm
  tip South from Southern Watch to the Holmsbys' farm by the river.
  accept 94999                          -- Eleanor Holmsby: Eyes for the Watchman
  accept 94923                          -- Robbie Holmsby: Hats Off

step Meadowsbrook and the river
  tip The fresh manure lies in the fields of Meadowsbrook just east of the farm; Robbie's hat is on the riverbank beyond, among the Mudfin murlocs.
  collect 266156 x4 quest 94842.2       -- Fresh Manure
  collect 266884 quest 94923.1          -- Robbie's Hat

step Robbie Holmsby
  turnin 94923

step Watcher Fredericks
  tip Watcher Fredericks keeps the west end of Southern Watch.
  turnin 94999

step The river, north
  tip North-east to the river below the lumber camp. Curly, one of Halligan's lumberjacks, is stuck by the river on the way and needs help from the camp. The Jumbo Crawfish keep to the shallows, and the Mudfin murlocs along the bank drop the heads.
  accept 94857                          -- Curly: If a Tree Falls, and No One Hears...
  collect 266157 x4 quest 94842.1       -- Jumbo Crawfish Shell
  collect 267266 x8 quest 94842.3 @44.6,60.5  -- Mudfin Murloc Head

step Turner's Logging Camp
  turnin 94931                          -- Halligan Turner
  turnin 94842
  accept 94843                          -- From Seed to Sprout

step Saplings
  tip Use Halligan's Tree Sprouting Kit on bare ground around the camp: five saplings.
  use 266161 quest 94843.1 @38.7,62.6   -- Tree Sprouting Kit

step Hurley
  tip Hurley stands at the camp's south end. He sets off for Curly, south-east of the camp, as soon as you take Helping Hands: go with him and keep the attackers off. If it fails, Hurley offers the quest again.
  turnin 94857                          -- Hurley
  accept 94861                          -- Helping Hands
  complete 94861 @46.0,70.8             -- go with Hurley to save Curly

step Halligan Turner
  turnin 94843
  turnin 94861

step Farholde Keep
  tip East along the road, past Wheeler's Grange, to Farholde Keep. Gretchen Mayberry, the gryphon master, stands at its western gate; Bertrand Ironbrow and Ember Bladewhisper are on the way in, Brother Lowley tends the wounded by the barracks, Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall wait in the keep at the east end, and the inn is in the south of the walls.
  getfp "Farholde Keep" npc 257087      -- Gretchen Mayberry, at the western gate
  accept 95943                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow: Foreman's Plight
  accept 95156                          -- Ember Bladewhisper: Stuff 'Em and Stick 'Em
  accept 96081 optional                 -- Brother Lowley: twenty Mageweave Cloth, which Sunnyglade's cultists and the pirates drop; hand it in on your way back in part 3
  turnin 95148                          -- Demar Brant, in the keep
  accept 94613                          -- My Kingdom for a Horse
  accept 94877                          -- Saving Sunnyglade: for part 2
  accept 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall: Curious Trinkets, for part 2
  accept 94879                          -- Scraps of Knowledge, for part 2
  sethome "Farholde Keep" npc 257595   -- Barracks Master Harlan, at the inn

step Tessa Dawnbright
  tip Tessa Dawnbright stands west of the inn, by the orchard: the apples hang on the trees around it.
  accept 95561                          -- Apple of My Eye
  collect 271431 x6 quest 95561.1       -- Fresh Apple
  turnin 95561
  accept 95913                          -- Fit for a Princess

step The cathedral
  tip Sister Rowland keeps the old cathedral at the south-west corner of Farholde Keep. The bats roost in its upper floor; Marla Bell hands out the holy candles beside it; the graves are in the chapel graveyard.
  accept 95603                          -- Bats in the Belfry
  kill 262037 x5 quest 95603.1          -- Roosting Duskbat
  turnin 95603
  accept 95613                          -- Keeping the Light On
  collect 17028 x5 quest 95613.1 @62.2,86.0  -- Holy Candle, from Marla Bell
  turnin 95613
  accept 95615                          -- In Memoriam
  use 269997 quest 95615.1 @61.9,83.8   -- Bundle of Candles, on the graves
  turnin 95615

step Wheeler's Grange
  tip West to Wheeler's Grange: Benjy Wheeler stands by the farmhouse.
  turnin 94613                          -- Benjy Wheeler
  accept 94615                          -- Foal Play
  accept 94614                          -- Freshwater Fiends

step The stables
  tip Search around the stables south of the farmhouse for the horses' tracks; the bundles of hay lie around the farm.
  collect 267223 quest 94615.1          -- Pawprint Tracing
  collect 268536 x3 quest 95156.1       -- Bundle of Hay

step Benjy Wheeler
  turnin 94615
  accept 94617                          -- Coyote Huntin'
  accept 94618                          -- Wheeler's Fleeing Steeds

step The coyote den
  tip The coyotes den in the hills south of the farm: Sootfur, the big dark one, sits at the back of it; the Plains Coyotes around it drop the pelts.
  collect 271432 x3 quest 95913.1       -- Coyote Pelt
  collect 265738 quest 94617.1          -- Sootfur's Pelt

step The river murlocs
  tip West of the den, down to the river: the Mudfin Warriors and Oracles line the banks.
  kill 258574 x8 quest 94614.1 @50.1,79.4  -- Mudfin Warrior
  kill 258573 x8 quest 94614.2 @50.1,79.4  -- Mudfin Oracle

step The lost horse
  tip One of Benjy's horses ran north up the river, past the farm. Give it the feed, then lead it home.
  turnin 94618                          -- Lost Horse
  accept 94992                          -- Rescue Roundup
  complete 94992 @54.9,73.0             -- walk it back to Wheeler's Grange

step Benjy Wheeler
  turnin 94992
  turnin 94617
  turnin 94614

step Foreman's Crate
  tip North up the track towards Terral's Watch: the foreman's crate lies by the road.
  collect 271620 quest 95943.1          -- Foreman's Crate

step Terral's Watch
  tip Watcher Cornelius holds Terral's Watch, the tower on the plains north-east of the crate.
  accept 94924                          -- Hunting the Hunters
  accept 94925                          -- A Fur Trade

step King of the Wild Plains
  when group 95986
  tip Ombassa, an elite lion (level 41), prowls the plains north of the tower: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95986                          -- Watcher Cornelius

step The plains
  tip The Rog'mar Poachers hunt the plains north of the tower; the Wildplains lions roam among them. A picked carcass lies in the grass east of the tower: its skull starts A Feast for Buzzards.
  accept 95983                          -- Picked Carcass: A Feast for Buzzards
  kill 259052 x12 quest 94924.1 @58.0,59.0  -- Rog'mar Poacher
  collect 266888 x8 quest 94925.1       -- Prized Lion Hide

step Ombassa
  when group 95986
  collect 281052 quest 95986.1 @59.6,53.6  -- Ombassa's Hide

step Terral's Watch
  turnin 94924                          -- Watcher Cornelius
  turnin 94925
  turnin 95983
  accept 94928                          -- A Few Furs for Friz: for Powderfuse Port (part 2), keep it
  accept 95984                          -- Song of the Strider: for part 2, where the tallstriders graze by Sleebo's workshop; keep it
  accept 95064                          -- Preventative Measures: for part 2, at the Horde's training grounds north of Rog'mar
  accept 95426                          -- Rog'mar Supplies: for part 2, the same training grounds

step Watcher Cornelius
  when onquest 95986
  turnin 95986

step Farholde Keep
  tip South back to Farholde Keep.
  turnin 95156                          -- Ember Bladewhisper
  turnin 95943                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow
  turnin 95913                          -- Tessa Dawnbright
  accept 95961                          -- Stepped Out: for Gray Dawnbright in Powderfuse Port (part 2), keep it

step WANTED: Ghostmaw
  when group 95991
  tip Ghostmaw is an elite (level 42) who hunts along the river between Wheeler's Grange and Terral's Watch, on your way north in part 2: grouping up is advised. The poster hangs by the keep; Wheatley, who takes the fang, stands south of the inn.
  accept 95991                          -- the WANTED! poster

step WANTED: Blademaster Kaijo
  when group 95912
  tip Blademaster Kaijo is an elite (level 42) at the Horde's training grounds north of Rog'mar, where part 2 goes: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95912                          -- the Wanted poster
